==Icelandic==

===Etymology 1===
From {{m|is|nokkur}}.

====Adverb====
{{is-adv}}

# [[fairly]], [[quite]]
#: {{ux|is|Þetta er '''nokkuð''' gott.|This is '''rather''' good.}}
#: {{ux|is|Er þetta '''nokkuð''' slæmt?|This is bad, isn't it?}}
#: {{ux|is|Ertu '''nokkuð''' með [[bók]]ina?|Do you '''by any chance''' have the [[book]]?}}

